1. ALTER ADD INDEX is denied.
2. CREATE TABLE is denied.
3. ALTER ADD INDEX ON CLUSTER is denied.
4. CREATE TABLE ON CLUSTER is denied on the legacy entry-format path.
5. So is an ALIAS column of the same query on the legacy entry-format path.
6. An alias renamed by an earlier command of the same ALTER is denied.
7. Also with ON CLUSTER.
8. Indices inherited by CREATE TABLE AS ON CLUSTER are denied on the legacy entry-format path.
9. ALTER ADD INDEX ON CLUSTER with a transform needs the table on the initiator.
10. Accepted with the privilege.
